      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is a complete poetic rhyming translation of Maoz Tsur with all six of its stanzas including a seventh, final stanza written by Isaac Gantwerk Mayer specifically for Yom ha-Atsmau’ut. The poetic translation of the first stanza also differs from the translation he offered in his earlier translation of Maoz Tsur for Ḥanukkah.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
